  "description": "<div class=\"content\" aria-description=\"\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<div class=\"ac-container ac-adaptiveCard\">\r\n<div class=\"ac-textBlock\">\r\n<p><strong>Collaborate with Studio Sharon Guy: Bridal Magic Awaits!</strong></p>\r\n<hr>\r\n<p><strong>Dear future partner,</strong></p>\r\n<p>We hope this message finds you well! 🌟</p>\r\n<p><strong>Studio Sharon Guy</strong> extends a warm welcome to you. As creators ourselves, we understand the power of storytelling and the magic it brings to life. Allow us to introduce ourselves:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Who We Are</strong>: We are Sharon and Zvika Guy, the heart and hands behind our unique handmade bridal wear and accessories.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Our Passion</strong>: Every stitch, every bead, every lace detail&mdash;we pour our passion into creating bridal pieces that resonate with individuality and elegance.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Budget-Aware Beauty</strong>: Our focus? <strong>Budget-aware brides</strong> who seek quality without compromise. We offer mix-and-match 2-piece outfits and modular accessories that elevate the bride&rsquo;s look at an <strong>affordable cost</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Where You Come In</strong>: We believe in collaboration. Your creativity, your voice&mdash;these are the threads that weave our story. Together, we can inspire brides-to-be worldwide.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Welcome Offer</strong>: Explore our collection, experience the craftsmanship, and let&rsquo;s embark on this bridal journey together. 🌸</p>\r\n<p>As marketing novices, we&rsquo;re eager to learn and adapt. Please feel free to reach out&mdash;share your insights, preferences, and the best way to collaborate. We&rsquo;re all ears!</p>\r\n<p><strong>Best Regards,</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Sharon and Zvika Guy</strong> <em>Studio Sharon Guy</em></p>\r\n<hr>\r\n<p>Thank you for considering us, and we look forward to creating something extraordinary with you! 🎨👰✨</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<cib-overlay></cib-overlay></div>",
